---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | OpenInterstate"
  description="OpenInterstate is a public open data project for the US interstate highway system, built on neutral names, reproducible releases, and explicit lineage."
>
  <section>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      OpenInterstate is public data infrastructure for the US interstate
      highway system, maintained independently of any single app or vendor.
      The published contract defines the data, and downstream tools adapt to
      it rather than the other way around.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Use neutral, boring public names</li>
      <li>Publish reproducible, checksummed releases</li>
      <li>Keep lineage and attribution explicit</li>
      <li>Optimize for developers and GIS users first</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
